    "rich_text_3wwWtG": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_WKNxDj": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Returns & Reprint Policy",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_6WprAx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>We'll Make It Right</h3><p>We want every DESCECI DTF transfer order to arrive exactly as expected.</p><p>If there is an issue with your order, please contact us with your <strong>order number and clear photos of the issue</strong>. Our team will review your request and work with you to provide an appropriate resolution.</p><p>We may offer a <strong>replacement, reprint, or other appropriate solution</strong> for verified production or fulfillment issues, including:</p><p>✓ Wrong transfer received<br/><br/>✓ Printing defects<br/><br/>✓ Transfers damaged before or during delivery<br/><br/>✓ Missing items<br/><br/>✓ Production or fulfillment errors</p><p>Please contact us as soon as possible after receiving your order so we can review the issue and help make it right.</p><h3>Custom Order Notice</h3><p>Because DTF transfers are <strong>custom-made specifically from the artwork, dimensions, quantities, and specifications submitted with your order</strong>, returns, refunds, or complimentary reprints generally do not apply to customer-submitted errors or changes requested after production has started.</p><p>This includes:</p><p>× Incorrect artwork uploaded<br/><br/>× Incorrect size or quantity selected<br/><br/>× Spelling or design errors in submitted artwork<br/><br/>× Low-resolution or poor-quality artwork<br/><br/>× Incorrect colors contained in the submitted design<br/><br/>× Change of mind after production has started</p><p><strong>Please review your artwork and order details carefully before submitting your order.</strong></p><p>If you're unsure whether an issue qualifies for a reprint or replacement, contact us. Our team will review the situation and help determine the best solution.</p>"
          }
        },
